{"id":"619868","name":"包菜鸡蛋炒沙河粉","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619868/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干沙河粉","amount":"340g"}],"sub":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"沙河粉泡六小时以上。","img":"images/619868/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"包菜洗净沥干，撕成小片。","img":"images/619868/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香辣牛肉干备好，没有可以不用，或者用老干妈辣椒系列代替。","img":"images/619868/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋三个，搅匀。","img":"images/619868/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"河粉放入开水锅中煮二分钟，倒出，沥干开水，用冷水冲凉。","img":"images/619868/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再沥干水。","img":"images/619868/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅预热，放油，中火。","img":"images/619868/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋炒熟，盛出。","img":"images/619868/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中再加点油，大火，放入包菜，炒软。","img":"images/619868/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒软后放盐","img":"images/619868/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入沙河粉，翻炒二分钟。","img":"images/619868/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放生抽，炒匀。","img":"images/619868/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入香辣牛肉干，炒匀。","img":"images/619868/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炒好了。","img":"images/619868/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘，美味。筋道入味。","img":"images/619868/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}